{"4541270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cards Of Calling", "steam_appid": 4541270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4773230], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Command your creatures. Build your strategy. Survive the unknown.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cards of Calling</strong> is a roguelike deckbuilder where you don’t fight alone — you summon and command a pack of creatures to battle for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck, grow your army, and adapt your strategy as every run presents new challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🐺 Lead Your Pack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon creatures to the battlefield and fight alongside them.<br>Each minion has its own role — from aggressive attackers to defensive protectors — and your strength depends on how you use them together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4541270/extras/bdb259e69007035bb237dc70bdb1a9c1.poster.avif?t=1786042994\" width=720 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4541270/extras/bdb259e69007035bb237dc70bdb1a9c1.webm?t=1786042994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4541270/extras/bdb259e69007035bb237dc70bdb1a9c1.mp4?t=1786042994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🃏 Build Around Synergy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cards don’t just deal damage — they interact with your creatures.<br>Gain powerful bonuses when minions are present, sacrifice them for massive effects, or create unstoppable combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4541270/extras/c96f37e89c9e40d8318b209c9aeef96d.poster.avif?t=1786042994\" width=720 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4541270/extras/c96f37e89c9e40d8318b209c9aeef96d.webm?t=1786042994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4541270/extras/c96f37e89c9e40d8318b209c9aeef96d.mp4?t=1786042994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⚔️ Tactical Turn-Based Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face dangerous enemies with unique behaviors and intents.<br>Plan your turns carefully, manage your energy, and decide when to attack, defend, or empower your army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4541270/extras/563a19ea25ce231f9cbfb32c2033987f.poster.avif?t=1786042994\" width=720 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4541270/extras/563a19ea25ce231f9cbfb32c2033987f.webm?t=1786042994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4541270/extras/563a19ea25ce231f9cbfb32c2033987f.mp4?t=1786042994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🗺️ Explore a Living World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through a 3D overworld filled with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elite encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysterious events</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice matters — risk and reward shape your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4541270/extras/db09fd064953de2ae12a741549e1a4ee.poster.avif?t=1786042994\" width=720 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4541270/extras/db09fd064953de2ae12a741549e1a4ee.webm?t=1786042994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4541270/extras/db09fd064953de2ae12a741549e1a4ee.mp4?t=1786042994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🔁 Replayable Runs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are the same.<br>Discover new cards, build different strategies, and refine your playstyle with every attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4541270/extras/b88c3b89bc1cf64a11f0ea8de8c2c655.poster.avif?t=1786042994\" width=720 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4541270/extras/b88c3b89bc1cf64a11f0ea8de8c2c655.webm?t=1786042994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4541270/extras/b88c3b89bc1cf64a11f0ea8de8c2c655.mp4?t=1786042994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you master the bond between summoner and beast… or fall with your army?</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Command your creatures. Build your strategy. Survive the unknown.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cards of Calling</strong> is a roguelike deckbuilder where you don’t fight alone — you summon and command a pack of creatures to battle for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck, grow your army, and adapt your strategy as every run presents new challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🐺 Lead Your Pack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Su